    "name": "oiv_prod_usd \u2014 register MultiSend unwrappers on the sub + manager Roles Modifiers",
    "description": "setTransactionUnwrapper(MultiSend, multiSend(bytes), MultiSendUnwrapper) and the same for MultiSendCallOnly, on the sub Roles Modifier 0xB15400Bb735CF9d91E09d097f2dA588ebe760D49 and the manager Roles Modifier 0x988A15711CCDF16C06010bb41AaEBF39e407cD7F. Both are owned by this Manager Safe. Without these the modifier cannot decompose a batched multiSend and rejects it wholesale. Txs 1-2 (sub ZRM) are the ones reported in the 2026-07-24 thread; txs 3-4 (manager ZRM) close the identical gap on the third modifier, which has the same missing registration. The exec Roles Modifier is owned by the OIV Safe \u2014 see oiv-prod-usd-unwrappers-oiv-safe.json.",
